<title>UK: Holiday Inns president, chief exec, quits.</title>
<headline>Holiday Inns president, chief exec, quits.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK drinks and leisure giant Bass Plc said on Monday it had accepted the resignation of Tim Lane, the president and chief executive of its hotels arm, Holiday Inns Inc, with immediate effect.</p>
</text>
